{"sourceUrl":"https://ibms.suda.edu.cn/df/18/c3465a712472/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:51.220330+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ibms.suda.edu.cn/df/18/c3465a712472/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>根据上级文件要求，结合学院具体情况，特制定本细则。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、接收专业</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院全日制硕士研究生招生专业均可接收推免生，具体专业请登录“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”查阅。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、报名程序</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．推免生登录“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>），在“招生栏目”中选择“全国优秀大学生推免预报名”进行注册、预报名（报名截止时间以系统为准）。</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>特别提醒：该系统是研究生院录取环节的“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”，不是教务处推荐环节的“苏州大学本科生推免申请系统”，请不要混淆！</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>考生须提前准备以下材料：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）我校研究生报考服务系统打印的推免申请表并本人签字。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）直博生需提供两位与申请学科有关的正高职称专家的推荐信（附件一），申请推免硕士生不用提交推荐信。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）本科期间成绩单（由所在学校教务部门提供并加盖公章），大学英语等级证书，各类获奖证书及其他证明自己学习研究等水平和能力的材料；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span><span><span>）开通后，所有推免生（包括前期已在我校“苏州大学研究生报考服务系统”预报名的考生）务必登录教育部系统填写申请信息。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>三、复试与录取</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．复试考核。根据材料审核择优筛选进入复试考核名单。考核形式为线上面试。专家考核小组从思想政治、外语应用能力与水平、科研能力与创新潜质、学业水平与专业素养等几方面对考生进行综合考核。考核时间拟定于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．录取工作。综合考核成绩以百分制计分，满分</span></span></span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span><span><span>分，</span></span></span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span><span><span>分为合格。未参加复试、综合考核成绩小于</span></span></span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以及思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格的不予录取。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．教育部“推免服务系统”开通后，获得推免资格且复试考核通过的考生进行网上报名并网上缴费（未缴费的考生视为放弃推免资格），分别确认接收复试通知和待录取通知。考生在“全国推免服务系统”可以接受多个复试通知，但只能接受一个待录取通知，确认录取后不得更改。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．推荐免试生占原推荐学校的推荐指标，占我校</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年各基层研究生招生单位的硕博招生计划。被我校录取的推免生，如果在入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，录取资格无效。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span><strong>所有推免生的资格审核确认、报考、录取均须通过教育部“推免服务系统”进行，未通过“推免服务系统”录取的考生一律无效。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．其他未尽事宜及相关要求见苏州大学研究生院网页－招生工作－招生动态栏。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>五、考生咨询及申诉渠道</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．联系部门：苏州大学生物医学研究院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>0512-65882135</span></span></p><p><span><span> 3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span>lixin1994@suda.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>生物医学研究院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"dd60ed8d1447ec79f809f169d8742eefafd73cdc2addd2bfbdfca9843d881eb5","textLength":1133,"sourceSha256":"765c959f1886614afb8eb37be532451ab64c3ab223ebf614ca32635304e56b5f","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9beae1d20e98fb8815df","title":"2026年苏州大学生物医学研究院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生综合考核实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:51.220330+00:00"}
